<title>USA: Athol, Mass, won by State Street.</title>
<headline>Athol, Mass, won by State Street.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>State Street Bank &amp; Trust Co. said it won $3.300 million of Athol, Mass., various municipal purpose loan of 1997 bonds, with a true interest cost of 4.9483 percent.</p>
</text>
